  "summary": "Extractor writes outside chroot through existing symbolic link in github.com/saracen/fastzip",
  "details": "Extractor.Extract checks archive entry paths lexically against the destination chroot and then creates files, directories, and symbolic links using path-based os calls that follow symbolic links already present under the chroot, allowing writes and metadata changes outside the destination directory.",
